  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Thinly slice brown onion (see ingredients).\n• Thinly slice pear into wedges.\n• Roughly chop silverbeet.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Roughly chop Brie.\n• Pick thyme leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743b13c30d33981f996a3c/step-aaf0a700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion and sliced mushrooms until tender, 6-8 minutes.\n• Add herb & mushroom seasoning and garlic, then cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add risotto rice and stir to coat. Add the water (for the rice), thyme and stock concentrate.\n• Bring to the boil, then remove from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743b13c30d33981f996a3c/step-b8169410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer risotto to a baking dish.\n• Cover tightly with foil and bake until liquid is absorbed and rice is ‘al dente’, 24-28 minutes.\n• TIP: ‘Al dente’ rice is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743b13c30d33981f996a3c/step-f3c72a20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When risotto has 10 minutes remaining, wash out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with the butter.\n• Cook pear wedges, turning occasionally, until softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium-low, then carefully add the balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and water (for the pear) and cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743b13c30d33981f996a3c/step-0988b430.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Remove risotto from oven and stir through the chopped Brie until melted.\n• Stir in silverbeet, a good squeeze of lemon juice, until combined and slightly wilted. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• TIP: If rice is dry, add a splash of water and stir through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743b13c30d33981f996a3c/step-73398e40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide golden Brie and oven-baked mushroom risotto between bowls.\n• Top with caramelised pears.\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743b13c30d33981f996a3c/step-4a75b950.jpg"
    }
  ]
